# Relative Imports

- If you are inside features/some_module/ then you may access other files inside that relatively. Treat this as a standalone dart library.
- If you are accessing ANYTHING in the project outside of that feature / module folder, you MUST use a package import

i.e.

```
features/
  auth/
    auth.api.dart
    src/
      domain/
        some_entity.dart
      ui/
        some_view.dart
  orders/
    orders.api.dart
    src/
      domain/
        some_entity.dart
      ui/
        some_view.dart

```

- If you are in auth/src/ui/ you may access everything inside src/ relatively
- You may NOT access anything inside orders/ relatively, and instead must import via package import of the `*.api.dart` file
